          en: 'In the Seducing Woods, [[nami|Nami]], [[tony-tony-chopper|Chopper]] and [[carrot|Carrot]] are ambushed by a rabbit riding a crane, swinging his spear so fast that only Carrot’s ears, which hear him coming, save them. They run to find [[monkey-d-luffy|Luffy]], but he keeps after them, and Carrot turns to fight him: he is no mink, she realises, because he cannot use electro. A jolt of her own brings the crane down. Randolph leaps clear and hurls his spear after them; they dodge, and it lodges in the head of the big man buried up to his neck nearby.',
